/** Handles the gateway command family: the view, the config saves and removals with their validation, the consent stamps, the key store and revocation behind the vault seam, the modellist refreshes with the cache window, the chat streams with their budget gates and provenance audit, the cursor polls of the incremental rendering, the cancellation and the template seeding of the per task prompt library. */
